<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF buys 40,000T of Brazilian soymeal.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF buys 40,000T of Brazilian soymeal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) has bought 40,000 tonnes of Brazilian soymeal from G. Premjee at $317.14 a tonne C&amp;F, the NLCF said on Friday.  </p>
<p>An NLCF official said arrival was set by July 20 to the three South Korean ports of Inchon, Kunsan and Ulsan.</p>
<p>Traders said the price included premiums for port rotation and shore-crane charges.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
